uPlay objective\nSet Special Ad Category = Housing\nName the campaign: TOF | EDU VIDEO | [MARKET] (use Campaign Name Auto formula)\nTurn Campaign Budget Optimization / Advantage+ campaign budget OFF\nCreate one ad set per approved video\nSet each ad set to $10/day unless client specifies otherwise\nSet geography to the approved client market\nPlacements: Facebook Feed, Instagram Feed, Facebook Reels, Instagram Reels, Facebook Video Feeds\nName each ad set using Ad Set Name Auto formula\nCreate one ad inside each ad set\nUpload the correct approved recorded video\nUse the correct Facebook Page and Instagram identity\nUse light primary text only\nCTA: Comment OPTIONS / DM OPTIONS\nRun QA: correct name, correct video, correct identity, correct geo, correct budget, Special Ad Category = Housing, CBO off, placements correct\nPublish\n\nCAMPAIGN 2: MOF | RETARGET\n\nOpen Ads Manager and click Create\nName the campaign: MOF | RETARGET | [MARKET]\nSet Special Ad Category = Housing\nBuild hot-viewer ad set: VV75-95 | 30-60D\nBuild engagers ad set: ENGAGERS | 30-90D (FB Page + IG + messaging engagers)\nBuild form-openers ad set ONLY if that audience exists: FORM OPENERS | 30D\nExclude LEAD | Form Submitted | 180D from all ad sets\nUse more direct creative than Campaign 1 — proof, urgency, options framing\nName each ad: [Pain Angle] | Retarget | V1\nPublish\n\nCAMPAIGN 3: BOF | LEADS\n\nOpen Ads Manager and click Create\nChoose Leads objective\nChoose Instant Form as conversion location\nName the campaign: BOF | LEADS | [MARKET]\nSet Special Ad Category = Housing\nBuild only hot warm audiences: VV95 | 30D, VV75 | 90D, FORM OPEN NO SUBMIT | 30D\nExclude submitted leads\nCreate the Instant Form with fields: Full name, Phone, Email, Property address, Timeline to sell, Situation dropdown\nUse Higher Intent form type if lead quality needs tightening\nName each ad: [Pain Angle] | Lead Ad | V1\nPublish\nSubmit a test lead and confirm it reaches the client CRM or Leads Center\n\nFINAL RULE: Andrew/client chooses which videos run. The VA does not choose videos. The VA builds, launches, checks, and tracks only what is approved.","placeholder":"","default_value":{"data":{},"html":"","preview":""},"width":2,"system":false,"valid":true,"is_migrating":false}},{"slug":"s121aee092","label":"Campaign Name","field_type":"textfield","params":{"primary":false,"restore_application_id":null,"max_length":null,"composite":null,"delimiter":", ","required":false,"unique":false,"hidden":false,"help_text_display_format":"tooltip","help_doc":null,"placeholder":"Write here","default_value":null,"width":1,"system":false,"valid":true,"is_migrating":false}},{"slug":"sa3ea1a428","label":"Ad Set Name","field_type":"textfield","params":{"primary":false,"restore_application_id":null,"max_length":null,"composite":null,"delimiter":", ","required":false,"unique":false,"hidden":false,"help_text_display_format":"tooltip","help_doc":null,"placeholder":"Write here","default_value":null,"width":1,"system":false,"valid":true,"is_migrating":false}},{"slug":"s0822bef9f","label":"Ad Name","field_type":"textfield","params":{"primary":false,"restore_application_id":null,"max_length":null,"composite":null,"delimiter":", ","required":false,"unique":false,"hidden":false,"help_text_display_format":"tooltip","help_doc":null,"placeholder":"Write here","default_value":null,"width":1,"system":false,"valid":true,"is_migrating":false}},{"slug":"client_launch_notified","label":"Client Launch Notified","field_type":"yesnofield","params":{"default_value":false,"display_format":"checkmark","color":"#3EAC40","help_text_display_format":"tooltip","primary":false,"placeholder":"Yes / No","system":false,"required":false,"unique":false,"hidden":false,"help_doc":null,"width":1,"valid":true,"is_migrating":false}},{"slug":"script_id","label":"Script ID","field_type":"textfield","params":{"primary":false,"restore_application_id":null,"max_length":null,"composite":null,"delimiter":", ","required":false,"unique":